<title>UK: Comerica Bank sets 200 mln mark five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Comerica Bank sets 200 mln mark five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers Bankhaus AG.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMERICA BANK</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    28.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +6.25 BP  PAY DATE    28.AUG.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  100.06    FULL FEES   0.20</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A	   REOFFER    =</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10	  SELL CONC  10	  PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	SENIOR BANK DEBT</p>
